      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip accent\">Pattern primer</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Design</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Hash map + list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Data structure design problems</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">\"Design a class with these methods, each in O(1)\" is one pattern: list the operations, give each one the structure that does it fast, then link the structures with shared handles so one update keeps them all in step. LRU and LFU caches, min stack, queue from stacks, randomized set, your own hash map, lazy iterators, hit counters, rate limiters and time-based stores, with templates in Go, C++, Java and Python.</p>\n"
